        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to introduce this fantastic 5 bed / 5 bath property to the letting market in Castle Avenue, Leixlip, Co. Kildare.\nThis spacious home is ideally located in a popular residential area of Leixlip, with a host of local amenities, shops, schools and restaurants all close by. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with easy access to the M4 and Dublin City Centre.\nThe property offers generous living accommodation throughout, with a bright and spacious living room, fully fitted kitchen/dining area and five well-proportioned bedrooms. The home also benefits from five bathrooms in total, offering excellent convenience for tenants.\nTo the rear is a private garden, while the property also benefits from off-street parking.\nAdditional features include an A rated BER, quality flooring, ample storage and well-maintained accommodation throughout.\nViewing is highly recommended contact RAY COOKE Lettings today to arrange your viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 5 bed / 5 bath\n- Semi-detached house\n- A rated BER\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Top quality blinds\n- Private off-street parking for a number of cars\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Separate utility room\n- Ample additional storage\n- Generous rear garden\n- Private enclosed rear garden\n- Low maintenance rear garden\n- Peaceful location\n- Located in the heart of Leixlip\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
